<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING FIRST-ROUND SCORES FROM U.S. WOMEN'S OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING FIRST-ROUND SCORES FROM U.S. WOMEN'S OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>CORNELIUS, Oregon 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>Thursday's first round of the U.S. Women's Open played on the</p>
<p>6,365-yard, par-71 Pumpkin Ridge course (U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>67  Liselotte Neumann (Sweden)</p>
<p>68  Susie Redman, Kelly Robbins, Deb Richard, Se Ri Pak (South</p>
<p>    Korea)</p>
<p>69  Lorie Kane (Canada), Trish Johnson (Britain), Muffin</p>
<p>    Spencer-Devlin, Nancy Lopez</p>
<p>70  Alicia Dibos (Peru), Rosie Jones, Jenny Chuasiriporn,</p>
<p>    Alison Nicholas (Britain), Pearl Sinn</p>
<p>71  Lisa Hackney (Britain), Kim Williams, Akiko Fukushima</p>
<p>    (Japan), Caroline Pierce (Britain), Dale Eggeling, Sherrin</p>
<p>    Smyers (Australia), Brenda Kuehn, Jill McGill, Jan Stephenson</p>
<p>    (Australia), Joan Pitcock</p>
